@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & Conditions";
    var termsVersion = LaundryHub2._0.Models.LaundryOrder.CurrentTermsVersion;
}

<section class="lh-section lh-terms-hero">
    <div class="lh-container">
        <div class="lh-terms-hero-card">
            <span class="lh-terms-kicker">Laundry Hub Davao City</span>
            <h1 class="lh-terms-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
            <p class="lh-terms-intro">These terms explain how our pickup, laundry, payment, and delivery services work. Please read them before creating an account or booking a pickup.</p>
            <div class="lh-terms-meta" aria-label="Terms document details">
                <span class="lh-terms-meta-item"><span>Version</span><strong>@termsVersion</strong></span>
                <span class="lh-terms-meta-item"><span>Effective date</span><strong>September 25, 2026</strong></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="lh-section lh-terms-body-section">
    <div class="lh-container lh-terms-layout">
        <aside class="lh-terms-index" aria-label="Terms sections">
            <div class="lh-terms-index-title">On this page</div>
            <ol>
                <li><a href="#acceptance">Acceptance and scope</a></li>
                <li><a href="#services">Services and hours</a></li>
                <li><a href="#pricing">Pricing and weight</a></li>
                <li><a href="#pickup">Pickup requests</a></li>
                <li><a href="#payment">Payment and late fees</a></li>
                <li><a href="#delivery">Delivery</a></li>
                <li><a href="#changes">Cancellations and changes</a></li>
                <li><a href="#care">Laundry care and claims</a></li>
                <li><a href="#privacy">Privacy and security</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Changes and contact</a></li>
            </ol>
        </aside>

        <article class="lh-terms-content">
            <div class="lh-terms-callout">
                <strong>Booking acceptance:</strong> Checking the Terms &amp; Conditions box in the pickup form records your acceptance, the displayed version, and the acceptance time against your order.
            </div>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="acceptance">
                <h2>1. Acceptance and scope</h2>
                <p>These Terms &amp; Conditions apply to Laundry Hub Davao City pickup, washing, drying, ironing, dry-cleaning, and delivery services. By creating an account, requesting a pickup, checking the acceptance box, or using the service, you agree to these terms.</p>
                <p>If you do not agree with these terms, please do not book a pickup. We may update these terms from time to time. The version in effect when a booking is submitted applies to that booking unless a change is required by law.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="services">
                <h2>2. Services, coverage, and hours</h2>
                <p>Laundry Hub provides per-kilo laundry services in active Davao City service areas. Available services, rates, and service zones are shown on the website and may change as operations change.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Regular operating hours are Monday to Saturday, 8:00 AM to 7:00 PM.</li>
                    <li>The shop is closed on Sundays for equipment cleaning and sanitization.</li>
                    <li>Pickup and delivery availability depends on the selected service zone and rider capacity.</li>
                    <li>All pickup orders have a 3 kg minimum unless Laundry Hub provides a different confirmation.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="pricing">
                <h2>3. Pricing and weight confirmation</h2>
                <p>Rates are quoted in Philippine Pesos and are generally calculated per kilogram. The final charge is based on the verified weight recorded during in-shop scale weighing. A weight shown before pickup is an estimate and is not the final invoice.</p>
                <p>Laundry Hub may review the selected services, verified weight, and any applicable delivery charge before payment is confirmed. The customer should review the confirmed amount in the portal before completing payment.</p>
                <p>Pickup and delivery are free for qualifying orders weighing 5 kg or more. A flat delivery fee of ₱50 applies to orders below 5 kg, subject to the service zones shown on the website.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="pickup">
                <h2>4. Pickup requests and customer responsibilities</h2>
                <p>The customer is responsible for providing an accurate pickup address, mobile number, preferred schedule, and any fabric or handling instructions. Please make sure that someone can provide the laundry and access to the pickup location during the requested period.</p>
                <p>Please separate items according to the instructions provided and identify special-care items clearly. Keep the order number available while the order is being processed.</p>
                <p>Laundry Hub may adjust a pickup time or contact the customer when the address, access, or item details need clarification. The customer must notify Laundry Hub promptly if the pickup details change.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="payment">
                <h2>5. Payment, late fees, and unclaimed orders</h2>
                <p>Payment is due within 24 hours after Laundry Hub notifies the customer that the order is ready for delivery. Payment must be completed before the order is dispatched for delivery.</p>
                <p>Orders that remain unpaid after the 24-hour period may be subject to a late fee of 3% of the confirmed order total for each overdue day, or part of a day, up to a maximum of 30% of the confirmed total.</p>
                <p>If an order remains unpaid and unclaimed for 15 days after the payment deadline, Laundry Hub may mark it as abandoned. Please contact support as soon as possible if you need more time or believe an order was not received.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="delivery">
                <h2>6. Delivery</h2>
                <p>After payment is confirmed, Laundry Hub assigns a delivery rider and shares the order status in the customer portal. Delivery timing is an estimate and may be affected by traffic, weather, access conditions, or rider availability.</p>
                <p>The customer must provide a safe and accessible delivery location. A delivery photograph may be recorded as proof that the order was brought to the delivery location.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="changes">
                <h2>7. Cancellations and changes</h2>
                <p>A pending pickup request can be cancelled from the customer Booking History while it has not been assigned to a rider. To request a change after assignment or after processing begins, contact Laundry Hub support as soon as possible. Costs or charges already incurred may apply.</p>
                <p>Changes to an address, schedule, service, or special instructions are subject to rider availability and the status of the order.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="care">
                <h2>8. Laundry care and claims</h2>
                <p>Laundry Hub uses reasonable care when sorting, cleaning, drying, folding, and delivering each order. The customer should inspect the order at pickup or delivery and report missing, damaged, or incorrect items promptly using the order number and available evidence.</p>
                <p>Fabric behavior can vary because of the item’s material, age, condition, stains, and previous treatment. Customers should follow the care label on each item and provide clear instructions for unusual or delicate fabrics.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="privacy">
                <h2>9. Privacy and account security</h2>
                <p>To provide the service, Laundry Hub collects the account, contact, address, delivery, order, and payment-reference information needed to process a booking. Payment details are submitted to the payment provider; Laundry Hub does not need to receive or store your full card number.</p>
                <p>Keep your account credentials private and notify support if you believe your account has been accessed without permission. We handle information in accordance with applicable privacy and data-protection requirements.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="lh-terms-section" id="contact">
                <h2>10. Changes and contact</h2>
                <p>These terms may be revised to reflect changes in pricing, operations, or legal requirements. The version and effective date appear at the top of this page, and the version accepted for each booking is recorded with that order.</p>
                <p>Questions, concerns, or requests about these terms may be sent to <a href="mailto:support@laundryhub.ph">support@laundryhub.ph</a>. Please include your order number when contacting us about an existing booking.</p>
            </section>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="lh-section lh-terms-cta-section">
    <div class="lh-container">
        <div class="lh-terms-cta-card">
            <div>
                <h2>Ready to book a pickup?</h2>
                <p>Create an account or sign in, complete the booking form, and accept the current Terms &amp; Conditions before submitting your request.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lh-terms-cta-actions">
                <a href="/Account/Register" class="lh-btn lh-btn-primary">Create Account</a>
                <a href="/Account/Login" class="lh-btn lh-btn-outline">Log In</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer class="lh-footer lh-terms-footer">
    <div class="lh-container lh-terms-footer-inner">
        <div>
            <span class="lh-brand-title">Laundry Hub</span>
            <span class="lh-brand-tag">Davao City</span>
            <p class="lh-footer-desc">Pickup, laundry care, and delivery services across active Davao City zones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lh-terms-footer-links">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/Account/Login">Log In</a>
            <a href="/Account/Register">Create Account</a>
            <a href="mailto:support@laundryhub.ph">Support</a>
            <span>&copy; @DateTime.UtcNow.Year Laundry Hub</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
